{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（29日）晚上10時許，警方接獲報案，指一輛私家車於葵涌道往荃灣方向行駛，至荔景站對開時，懷疑失控撞毁一列水馬，車輛繼而四輪朝天。</p><p>救援人員到場，發現沒有人受傷，意外起因仍有待調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.862890+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T15:16:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:18:59.138637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.862890+00:00","content_hash":"ae7adef5d532c3fc4a077210b171e00d3563376bab6656b82b7161a6dedc528b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}